---
/** The page foot. One line of identity, one line of where the code lives. */
---

<footer class="foot">
  <p class="foot__left num">
    Decision Arena &middot; apache-2.0 &middot; built for engineers who want
    the number, not the brochure
  </p>
  <p class="foot__right num">github.com/aswathas/decision-arena</p>
</footer>

<style>
  .foot {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.4rem clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem) 2.4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem 2rem;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .foot p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    color: var(--color-ink-45);
    max-width: 58ch;
  }
</style>
